  "body": "Hello,\nAfter thoroughly reviewing the source code of both BitNet and T-MAC, I noticed a high degree of overlap between the two. The code implementation seems quite similar, which raises some questions for me: What are the specific differences between BitNet and T-MAC in terms of architecture, algorithms, or optimization strategies? Are there any unique improvements or distinct use cases for each? I would appreciate it if you could clarify the distinctions between them.",
